# was (M6): where a transform's drag found P (FV 04, R5's "P before"). Both drag k's number box
# (its centre (383, 468) at 1440 x 900; M7 rewrote M6's model lines to the gesture, plan 5.1.5 (1)):
# a press that travels 3 px drags at the coarse rate, 0.02 a px, so +50 px holds k at 1.00, the
# button still down. P keeps its x (D15) and rides the curve from (2, 4) to (2, 5): a Ø22 ring
# dashed in 12 at (2, 4) in P's ink and a 2 px --primary arrow up to P; k active, so k's dimension
# line from (0, 0) to (0, 1); the ghost x² dashed under the curve x² + 1; the Original toggle in the
# tools; in the sidebar the ruler under k's row (M7) and P's "moved" (M8).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
down
move 433 468 over 160
wait 2000
shot was
